  "SAME pipeline it ships (build.classify_for_eval) and grades stage / source_type / region /",
  "evidence_type / strength / decision_type / payer_type. region, decision_type, payer_type are graded",
  "ONLY where the expected value is non-empty. Grading is title-based (summaries, which are promo",
  "teasers, are intentionally omitted) so it is fully reproducible. Three title-undecidable viewpoint/",
  "framework papers are excluded (documented limit). Titles are public; no private feed queries here."
